🌐 The Theme: A World's New Order
"The old alliances have shattered. The established treaties are worthless. In the ashes of the old world, new powers rise to dictate the future."
Your two countries must reflect this shifting balance:

How does the collapse or transformation of the old order affect their politics, economy, and military?
Do your two nations form a mutual pact to secure the region, or are they ideological rivals competing to fill the power vacuum?
Give players branching decisions: will they restore the old ways, embrace a radical new ideology, or conquer their neighbors?
